# Gateway mapper

GraphQL input → `IMapper` → gRPC request → client → `IMapper` → GraphQL model.

Methods on `Schema/IMapper.cs` and `Schema/Mapper.cs` only — all named `Map`. No `Mapping/` folder, no AutoMapper, no `*Mapping` types or `ToDto`/`ToContract` outside `IMapper`/`Mapper`.

Inject clients and mapper with `[Service]`. Pass `CancellationToken`.
